Description: Provides a local Shiny app for batch deidentification of transcript
    files. The app scans folders of WebVTT, Word, and plain-text transcripts,
    supports speaker relabeling, name and term redaction, likely-name review,
    and export to redacted transcript files. Designed for research workflows
    that require local, reproducible transcript deidentification.
